,"place_name_jianti_auto":"黔中","place_note":"湖南沅陵","start_index":50,"tongjian_id":"8c20513d-db0e-11ef-952b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":53,"tongjian_id":"8c20513e-db0e-11ef-b2a6-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"牂柯郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"牂柯郡","start_index":55,"tongjian_id":"8c20513f-db0e-11ef-a1cf-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"唐","place_name_jianti_auto":"唐","start_index":61,"tongjian_id":"8c205140-db0e-11ef-8dc3-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"黔中","place_name_jianti_auto":"黔中","start_index":63,"tongjian_id":"8c205141-db0e-11ef-8956-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"漢中郡，漢屬益州，自晉以後爲梁州。巴，卽春秋巴子之國，漢爲巴郡，屬益州，唐爲巴、渝、渠、果諸州之地。黔中，漢爲牂柯郡之地，唐爲黔中節度。黔，渠今翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"汉中郡，汉属益州，自晋以后为梁州。巴，即春秋巴子之国，汉为巴郡，属益州，唐为巴、渝、渠、果诸州之地。黔中，汉为牂柯郡之地，唐为黔中节度。黔，渠今翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":76,"tongjian_id":"8c20512c-db0e-11ef-b902-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"翟，與狄同。","note_content_jianti_auto":"翟，与狄同。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":83,"tongjian_id":"8c205142-db0e-11ef-89e2-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"朱元晦","people_name_jianti_auto":"朱元晦","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"8c205145-db0e-11ef-922a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"憤，房粉翻，懣也，怒也。朱元晦曰：憤者，心求通而未得之意。","note_content_jianti_auto":"愤，房粉翻，懑也，怒也。朱元晦曰：愤者，心求通而未得之意。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":113,"tongjian_id":"8c205144-db0e-11ef-92f8-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":-424,"link_death_year":-362,"link_td_description":"秦献公，嬴姓，战国时期秦国君主，秦灵公之子，在位23年。","link_td_id":"Q10001804","link_td_number_id":176315,"people_name":"秦獻公","people_name_jianti_auto":"秦献公","people_xingming":"嬴师隰","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8c205146-db0e-11ef-8c9e-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[嬴师隰]"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/一、唐虞 三代 春秋 战国 秦（卷一）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"今陕西榆林卫北有稒阳塞。郑，即今华州治。洛，洛水，《职方...","context_before":"...二水，见前《禹贡》及《周·职方》]，西有长城[《史记》：","source_end_index":135,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"424553ed-b748-55b0-8c63-7c2fc9d22585","source_start_index":88,"source_text":"魏惠王十九年，筑长城，塞固阳，以备秦及西戎。又《秦纪》云：魏筑长城，自郑滨洛以北，有上郡固阳。"}],"path":"历代州域形势纪要/一、唐虞 三代 春秋 战国 秦（卷一）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/〇、封域山川险要（卷五十二）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"其后秦数出兵攻魏，魏日以削。秦惠王六年，魏始纳阴晋[即今...","context_before":"...，秦兵不敢东向。武侯尝浮西河而下，所谓美哉山河之固者也。","source_end_index":300,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8e5a0768-dfec-539f-9b20-8e795d4ab86a","source_start_index":272,"source_text":"方是时，魏筑长城，自郑滨洛以北[郑，即今华州]，有上郡。"}],"path":"陕西方舆纪要/〇、封域山川险要（卷五十二）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/二、西安府下（卷五十四）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"后魏永熙末，高欢追魏主修，攻潼关，克之，进屯华阴长城，是...","context_before":"长城[在县西二里。","source_end_index":32,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"e5007c7b-f513-5fca-9b80-b5f1612baffa","source_start_index":9,"source_text":"《史记》：魏筑长城，自郑滨洛以北。此即其故址。"},{"context_after":"稍南有木屐塠四，在沮水岸侧。相传禹治水弃屐于此。泥积成塠...","context_before":"...此处。○长城，在县东五十里。洛水所经。阚骃以为即沮水也。","source_end_index":114,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"4cb9ead6-5996-58d8-83e7-10ffb3d49f9e","source_start_index":94,"source_text":"战国时为秦魏之疆，筑长城于此，名曰堑洛。"}],"path":"陕西方舆纪要/二、西安府下（卷五十四）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/四、汉中府（卷五十六）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"秦惠文君十三年，攻汉中，取地六百里，置汉中郡，而楚始见陵...","context_before":"府北瞰关中，南蔽巴蜀，东达襄、邓，西控秦、陇，形势最重。","source_end_index":69,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"d44a9821-b576-5ac4-8930-26bba26f8861","source_start_index":28,"source_text":"春秋以来属楚[《秦纪》：孝公元年，楚自汉中，南有巴黔中]，故楚为最强，秦不能难也。"}],"path":"陕西方舆纪要/四、汉中府（卷五十六）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"5秦獻公薨，子孝公立。孝公生二十一年矣。是時河、山以東強國六，淮、泗之間小國十餘，楚、魏與秦接界。魏築長城，自鄭濱洛以北有上郡；楚自漢中，南有巴、黔中：皆以夷翟遇秦，擯斥之，不得與中國之會盟。於是孝公發憤，布德修政，欲以強秦。","content_fanyi":"秦献公去世，他的儿子秦孝公即位。孝公出生已经二十一年了。这时黄河、华山以东有六个强国，淮水、泗水之间有十多个小国，楚国、魏国与秦国接界。魏国修筑长城，从郑邑沿洛水向北，置有上郡；楚国从汉中郡向南，占有巴郡、黔中郡之地：东方各国都把秦国当夷狄看待，排斥它，不让它参与中原各国的会盟。于是孝公发愤图强，施行恩德，修明政治，想使秦国强大。","content_jianti_auto":"5秦献公薨，子孝公立。孝公生二十一年矣。是时河、山以东强国六，淮、泗之间小国十余，楚、魏与秦接界。魏筑长城，自郑滨洛以北有上郡；楚自汉中，南有巴、黔中：皆以夷翟遇秦，摈斥之，不得与中国之会盟。于是孝公发愤，布德修政，欲以强秦。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":123,"number":5,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第二 (周紀二) / 顯王 / 七年 / 第 5 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"8c1dc752-db0e-11ef-9ac7-a0d3651f611f","year_int":-362},"tongjian_id":"8c1dc752-db0e-11ef-9ac7-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":3},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"周太王","people_name_jianti_auto":"周太王","start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"8c20515f-db0e-11ef-815c-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"班","people_name_jianti_auto":"班","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"8c205160-db0e-11ef-bf1f-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"秦穆公","people_name_jianti_auto":"秦穆公","start_index":55,"tongjian_id":"8c205161-db0e-11ef-b2e3-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"晉獻公","people_name_jianti_auto":"晋献公","start_index":59,"tongjian_id":"8c205162-db0e-11ef-a639-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"獻公","people_name_jianti_auto":"献公","start_index":65,"tongjian_id":"8c205163-db0e-11ef-80ce-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"穆公","people_name_jianti_auto":"穆公","start_index":73,"tongjian_id":"8c205164-db0e-11ef-b171-a0